# Workspace Porting Rules

- Primary workspace is `D:\TERRAINO\Quasimodo-RTX`.
- Reference GUI source is `D:\TERRAINO\experimental gui`.
- Use the reference project only for analysis and clean, intentional porting.
- Never blindly copy code; understand integration points and ownership first.
- Do not modify path tracer or RTX path tracing systems unless integration dependency is proven.
- Avoid local absolute paths in source, CMake, scripts, configs, RML, RCSS, and asset loading.
- Keep repository changes portable and buildable on another machine.
- Do not introduce external game names in commits, comments, logs, docs, debug labels, UI strings, or rules.
- Prefer small, reviewable changes with clear boundaries.
- Check `git diff` before and after edits.
- Build and smoke test when feasible before finalizing.
